<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index rose 2.40 to 646.59, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.05.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 292 to 291.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,183,130 compared with 27,910,820 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
